flowchart TB
  Entry[index.js: dotenv, Express, HTTP server] --> Middleware[CORS / JSON / cookie / static uploads]
  Entry --> Mount[Route mounts under /api]
  Mount --> Routes[auth, users, posts, jobs, connections, messages, notifications, contact]
  Routes --> Protect[protect JWT middleware on private groups]
  Routes --> Limit[express-rate-limit on selected endpoints]
  Routes --> Upload[Multer + storage selection]
  Routes --> Controllers[Controller functions]
  Controllers --> Models[Mongoose models]
  Models --> DB[(MongoDB)]
  Controllers --> Notify[notificationController.notifyUser]
  Notify --> Socket[Socket.IO getIO]
  Entry --> SocketInit[initializeSocket]
  SocketInit --> RedisAdapter[Redis adapter + presence]
  SocketInit --> Models
  Controllers --> External[GitHub / Cloudinary / SMTP integrations]
